gs.14.31\">1 K 14:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:24\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.24\">15:24</a> + 6 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">עִם־מַלְכֵי יִשְׂר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.13\">2 K 13:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.16\">14:16</a>); c. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:1\" href=\"/Numbers.20.1\">Nu 20:1</a> + 3 times; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחַת</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִתַּחַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:8\" href=\"/Genesis.35.8\">Gn 35:8</a>."}],"occurrences":"39","form":"Niph."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>bury</em> (in masses), c. acc.: Impf. 3 fs. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּקַבְּרֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:6\" href=\"/Hosea.9.6\">Ho 9:6</a>; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְקַבֵּר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.15\">1 K 11:15</a>; Pt. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְקַבְרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:4\" href=\"/Numbers.33.4\">Nu 33:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.14\">Ez 39:14</a>; as n. intens., of office, <em>burier</em>, sg. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְקַבֵּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.16\">Je 14:16</a>, pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.15\">Ez 39:15</a>."}],"all_cited":true,"form":"Pi."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁ֫מַּה קֻבַּר אַבְרָהָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:10\" href=\"/Genesis.25.10\">Gn 25:10</a>."}],"all_cited":true,"form":"Pu."}]},"rid":"BDB08640","strong_numbers":["6912"],"next_hw":"קֶ֫בֶר","prev_hw":"קִבְצַיִם","root":true,"occurrences":"132","quotes":[],"GK":["7699"],"TWOT":["1984"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver